#====================================================================
# Draft: STB-style single-header libraries: test_package consumers must
#        define the implementation macro (XXX_IMPLEMENTATION) before
#        #include, or linking fails with undefined symbol (lib_fts 1.2.8)
#====================================================================

id:                     DRAFT-LIB_FTS-1.2.8-STB-IMPLEMENTATION-MACRO
trigger_tool:           clang|clang++|ld.lld|conan|test_package
phase:                  compile|link
error_signature:        ld.lld: error: undefined symbol: fts::fuzzy_match|undefined symbol: .*IMPLEMENTATION|ld.lld: error: undefined symbol

severity:               2
category:               headers, conan, packaging, testing
match_keywords:         STB, single-header, header-only, IMPLEMENTATION, undefined symbol, ld.lld, test_package, FTS_FUZZY_MATCH_IMPLEMENTATION, FTS_FUZZY_MATCH_IMPLEMENTATION

title:                  STB 风格单头文件库（fts_fuzzy_match 等）的 test_package/消费者源必须在 include 前定义实现宏（如 FTS_FUZZY_MATCH_IMPLEMENTATION），否则声明可见而实现缺失 → 链接 undefined symbol

root_cause:             STB 风格单头文件库把完整实现放在 `#ifdef XXX_IMPLEMENTATION` 块内（公共接口只有声明）。consumers 只 `#include <header>` 而忘记定义宏时，编译期一切正常（头文件声明可见），但链接期 ld.lld 报 undefined symbol。这是 header-only 与常规库 test_package 的最大差异：header-only 库的"链接成功"依赖消费者正确实例化实现宏，配方本身没有可链接产物可兜底。

affected_scope:         Any STB 风格单头文件库（stb_image/stb_vorbis、doctest、fts_fuzzy_match 等）的 test_package 编写。Verified instance: lib_fts 1.2.8 (fts_fuzzy_match.h, tests/fuzzy_match/fts_fuzzy_match_test.cpp 上游即 `#define FTS_FUZZY_MATCH_IMPLEMENTATION` 后 include)。

verification_cmd:       conan create archives/l/lib_fts/1.2.8 -pr:h=ci/conan/profiles/ohos-aarch64 -pr:b=ci/conan/profiles/ohos-aarch64

rec_priority:           1
rec_approach:           define-implementation-macro-before-include
rec_description:        test_package 测试源（以及独立消费者程序）在 `#include <xxx.h>` 之前定义该库的实现宏 `#define FTS_FUZZY_MATCH_IMPLEMENTATION`（与上游 tests 用法一致，非平台宏、无需 patch）。实现宏不发生冲突：宏内部是 static 函数，单翻译单元实例化即可。
rec_command:            test_package/test.cpp 首行（include 前）添加对应宏定义
rec_auto_fix:           false
rec_impl:               archives/l/lib_fts/1.2.8/test_package/test.cpp 与 test_ohos.cpp

fallback_priority:      0
fallback_approach:
fallback_description:
fallback_command:
fallback_auto_fix:      false
fallback_impl: